[Trigger]
Name	nightfall
Mode	once
Cond	time	3
Action	message	1	Ebonrook is a black wood that keeps its own night, master. Warden Sabine Rook has hidden herself among the roots in the south and the rooks carry word of every move you make.
Action	objective	1	Kill Warden Sabine Rook in the roots of the south-west.
Action	objective	1	Cross the river by the north bridges.
Action	objective	1	Your gold is gone: mine, and feed your army from the glades.
Action	portal	1	off
[/Trigger]
